      {
        "n": "An Ibex Band Special: The Roha Band Years (R)",
        "s": "2026-10-26T09:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-10-26T11:00:00Z",
        "d": "The legendary Ibex Band - later known as the iconic Roha Band - played a key role in shaping Ethiopian music from the mid-1970s onward. Though hugely influential, their legacy remains underrecognised. In this special episode, NTS presents a two hour deep dive into their catalogue, tracing their evolution and showcasing rare, overlooked tracks from their archive. Join us as we celebrate the musicians behind the music and explore their lasting cultural impact. \nSpecial thanks to John Henriksson, Johan Egerbladh Eurenius, Muzikawi and Zuret Addis.\nImage courtesy of Selam Seyoum Woldemariam.",
        "j": "The Roha Band Years",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/an-ibex-band-special/episodes/an-ibex-band-special-the-roha-band-years-8th-august-2025",
        "t": "restream"
